{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2020-05-17 06:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Saudi's PIF Discloses Stakes In Boeing, Citigroup, Facebook Among U.S. Companies - Filing", 'text': "SAUDI'S PIF DISCLOSES STAKES IN BOEING, CITIGROUP, FACEBOOK AMONG US. COMPANIES - FILING.SAUDI'S PIF DISCLOSED $827.8 MILLION STAKE IN BP, $713.7 MILLION INVESTMENT IN BOEING, ABOUT $522 MILLION POSITIONS IN BOTH CITIGROUP & FACEBOOK AT Q1 END-FILING.SAUDI'S PIF DISCLOSED $495.8 MILLION STAKE IN WALT DISNEY CO AND $487.6 MILLION STAKE IN BANK OF AMERICA CORP AT Q1 END - FILING.SAUDI'S PUBLIC INVESTMENT FUND DISCLOSED $513.9 MILLION STAKE IN MARRIOTT, $78.4 MILLION STAKE IN BERKSHIRE HATHAWAY AT Q1 END - FILING."}